<title>Awaab's Law Phase 2: What North West Housing Associations Need to Know Before 30 November 2026 | AB Facilities Consultants</title>
<meta name="description" content="Phase 2 extends fixed repair-response deadlines beyond damp and mould to cold, heat, structural issues, electrical hazards and more. Here's what changes.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="site">
  <div class="container nav-row">
    <a href="/" class="logo"><img src="/assets/logo.png" alt="AB Facilities Consultants" style="height:44px;display:block"></a>
